  "abstract": "Covers Unicode MessageFormat (MessageFormat 2.0), UTS #35 Part 9: syntax, declarations, matchers, markup, the default functions, pattern selection, errors and fallback output, bidi isolation and the interchange data model, plus ICU MessageFormat 1 and its migration. It lists Unicode MessageFormat LDML 48 (current, pinned at 48.2), LDML 47 (supported), the MessageFormat 2.0 Tech Preview of LDML 45 to 46.1 (legacy), the LDML 49 draft (preview, track), and ICU MessageFormat 1 as its own family (pinned to the ICU4J 78 docs). SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, syntax and the data model, functions, selection and errors, and ICU MessageFormat 1 migration.",
